# Lean 4: Lean language reference (lean-lang.org/doc/reference): lexical structure, commands, tactics; requirements/languages/lean.md
name     lean lean4

keyword  def theorem lemma example abbrev structure class instance inductive where with match fun let
keyword  have show by do if then else for in return import open namespace section end variable universe
keyword  axiom noncomputable private protected partial mutual deriving calc at from extends unsafe
builtin  true false sorry rfl simp intro intros exact apply rw cases induction constructor omega decide
builtin  trivial assumption

ident-part     '.!?
line-comment   --
block-comment  /- -/  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
escape        : x=2 u4
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~
upper-type
hook     apostrophe
